        SEEK EYES -- Seek's eyes open on the walls of your room: do not look at them

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/SeekEyes"))()

        One after another, Seek's eyes (HonchoSeek's kit: the eye and the hand) open on the walls of the room you are in,
        and turn to follow you. Look at one and the bar at the top fills (the whispers louder, your heart beating); look
        away and it empties. Full: Seek's hands burst out of the floor around you and grab you (35 damage; at your last
        health, your death). Hidden, the eyes close and the bar empties fast. After half a minute they close one by one.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes).
]]

